        ]
      },
      "text": "Start your day early with a trip to the Inkaterra Canopy Walkway, a series of suspended bridges high above the forest floor. From here, you’ll have a bird’s-eye view of the rainforest and can spot treetop-dwelling creatures like toucans, monkeys, and sloths.\n\nVisit the Inkaterra Ecological Reserve and enjoy a guided walk through the pristine jungle. Look out for wildlife and listen to the symphony of sounds that surround you. You might also visit a local river community or explore the region’s natural history in a hands-on way. Relax with a traditional Amazonian dinner, followed by another night walk or optional stargazing session."
    },
